nd God bless you. You are not an ordinary person who would toss in the towel by now.\n\nYou won't give up, and neither should we.\nThank you for fighting for us, and May Almighty God  bless you and keep you. MAGA forever...", "author": "Alpha-Kil0", "created": 1793822424353, "profile_picture": "nFm7nABf3gi8", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "diverscale", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "This is why I could never be Trump.", "last_comment_created": 1793837092469, "content": "<p>Looking at what happened last night and how my own party fucked me and refuse to implement things they agree with, but are just too jealous and pussy to acknowledge that I came up with something they didn't have the charisma to pull off.</p>\n<p>Watching the greatest opportunity to give that party effectively almost sure bet to create a Conservative one party rule for generations, and reshape the country into a damn near Global Omni-power.</p>\n<p>Then to (once again) almost purposefully snatch defeat from the jaws of Victory, and have my political enemies promise to do the very things I said they would do if they ever got power back.</p>\n<p>I would just say, &quot;You know what? Fuck it. JD take over bud, I'm out.&quot; I couldn't handle that level of betrayal and duplicity. I'd take my millions and my hot wife, fire off a middle finger at Thune and tell him to sit on it and spin.</p>\n<p>That's why I'm not Trump. Because he can take it. He has more fortitude than I can muster. He's not gonna give up..ever. And for that Mr. President I say, thank you and God bless you. You are not an ordinary person who would toss in the towel by now.</p>\n<p>You won't give up, and neither should we.\nThank you for fighting for us, and May Almighty God  bless you and keep you. MAGA forever...</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 15, "score_up": 42, "is_edited": true, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2117961986839331089", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1AToYvJ2Uq", "is_twitter": true, "is_admin": false, "score": 156, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8921938, "raw_content": "", "author": "Throwingway22", "created": 1793796752441, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "YaharaRiver", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "twitter.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1AToYvJ2Uq.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://twitter.com/ThomBrady5/status/2117961986839331089", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Bottom line of last night", "last_comment_created": 1793821483427, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 17, "score_up": 156, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"twitter": {"quotedTweet": false, "images": false, "linkEmbed": false, "replies": 3, "created": 1793796462000, "id": "2117961986839331089", "video": false, "poll": false, "user": {"profilePicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1557505659926716416/tyJNa2e7_normal.png", "displayName": "Fugitive Caesar", "username": "ThomBrady5"}, "content": "Huge fumble by Trump. California, New York, and Texas are now all enemy territory, and Florida is run by an incompetent DEI hire. All of the crown jewels are tanking. Biden brought in 40 million legal and illegal foreigners, and Republicans were totally complacent about the scale", "parentTweet": false, "likes": 19}}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1AToYwOxNR", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 139, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8922009, "raw_content": "", "author": "grandfather_nurgle", "created": 1793798956537, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "HowCome", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "media.scored.co", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1AToYwOxNR.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://media.scored.co/post/qkyNJTK7jvHK.jpeg", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [{"reference": "/scale/YkjFXobWEAfeW6K7.jpeg", "width": 768, "content-type": "jpeg", "height": 737}], "blurhash": "UIF}cpIUoLs:_MRQWBWqt+oea}s:tRWVW;ay", "full_resolution": [1123, 1170]}, "title": "Me and the boys watching history repeat itself ", "last_comment_created": 1793821872281, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": true, "comments": 14, "score_up": 139, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1AToYwPVbg", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 106, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8922224, "raw_content": "I do not speak to my left leaning family. It's just my wife and I. We are in Michigan. Jokes aside, I'm worried about our future. We have a nice house. A Great life. Things are great. Our neighborhood is changing fast. We are surrounded by hostile Muslims. 3 Mosques in a 2 mile radius. More than all Churches of any religion. Yesterday we went for a walk and 2 fully hijabbed women walked past us. They were not going to give us room to walk but I stopped in front of them and they had to share the sidewalk, as I wasn't going to move for them. They do not care about us. On a larger scale, I know everyone says the whole \"Can't vote our way out of this\" thing.....It's the buzz term but It's true. I feel like we've been abandoned by our political party as they are double agents. I am feeling so down at the moment. My wife says don't worry. Focus on our life. Focus on positive things. It seems like the Democrats will jail all of our people. We will lose rights. Once we get completely outnumbered, I could see where my wife would have to wear a hijab to go under the radar and be, at least, slightly safer.......I can't see how we will ever regain any power again. I'm not trying to argue with anyone but I could really use some positive proactive discourse. You guys are the only community I have. This is my first actual post. Usually I say snarky things or mean things but all that aside, I'm really worried. ", "author": "Bigpoppatrump420", "created": 1793804115610, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Comntrinchief", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Hey Guys. Feeling really concerned.", "last_comment_created": 1793835735642, "content": "<p>I do not speak to my left leaning family. It's just my wife and I. We are in Michigan. Jokes aside, I'm worried about our future. We have a nice house. A Great life. Things are great.